  "title": "Low-Arousal Speech Noise Improves Performance in N-Back Task: An ERP Study",
  "authors": "Han L et al., 2013",
  "research_question": "To investigate the effects of low vs. high emotional arousal speech noises on working memory performance and event-related potentials (ERPs) during an n-back task.",
