    "description": "Twenty-two healthy subjects (12 females; age range = 18 to 24, mean = 21.3 years) who were right-handed, had no history of neurological diseases, were free of regular medication, had normal hearing, and normal or corrected-to-normal vision. Recruited from Beijing Normal University.",
