  },
  "stimuli_or_exposures": [
    {
      "type": "audio",
      "description": "Meaningless pseudo-sentences (30 fearful, 30 happy) from a validated Chinese vocal emotional stimuli database, carefully matched for valence, recognition rate, duration, and fundamental frequency. Divided into low-arousal (15 fearful, 15 happy) and high-arousal (15 fearful, 15 happy) groups based on arousal ratings. Presented at 60 dB SPL. A silent condition was also included. The n-back task involved visually presented cardinal numbers (0-9).",
