  "limitations": [
    "The study only investigated the effects of emotional arousal of speech noises on working memory performance in healthy subjects.",
    "Future studies could investigate the effects of different types of emotional arousal (e.g., positive vs. negative) and different noise intensities.",
    "The study did not investigate the long-term effects of noise exposure."
